#: ../../../reference/interfaces/nomad-support-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/nomad-support-interface.md:8
msgid "nomad-support interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/nomad-support-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The `nomad-support` interface provides permissions to enable [HashiCorp "
"Nomad](https://www.nomadproject.io/) to access [cpuset](https://man7.org/"
"linux/man-pages/man7/cpuset.7.html) CPU and memory management, alongside "
"Nomad-specific capabilities such as the NVIDIA plugin support, slice "
"functions, and Nomad running as a service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/nomad-support-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"See {ref}`Interface management <how-to-guides-work-with-snaps-connect-"
"interfaces>` and {ref}`Supported interfaces <ref-index_interfaces>` for "
"further details on how interfaces are used."
msgstr ""

